# June 2026 design study: a local copy of another company's landing page.
# Never committed, so never served from atlasrouge.com — verified 2026-08-04.
# Ignored so a wide `git add public/` cannot publish it by accident.
public/prueba/

# NOTE: public/vendre/fonts/ (commercial Lazzer typeface) is NOT listed here.
# Those files are already TRACKED, and .gitignore does not apply to tracked
# files — listing them would only create a false sense of protection. They are
# live at atlasrouge.com/vendre/fonts/*.woff (verified 2026-08-04: HTTP 200,
# application/font-woff). Removing them needs the owner's explicit approval.

# graphify writes a dated backup of the previous graph on every rebuild.
# Regenerable and large (~50k lines); the current graph is what travels.
graphify-out/20*/
